      <div class="biography">
        <p>I'm currently a PhD student at the University of Waterloo under the supervision of Elana Kalashnikov and Ruxandra Moraru.</p>
        <p>My research lies at the intersection of geometry and combinatorics, with connections to mathematical physics. I study how combinatorial structures, such as matroids and polyhedral decompositions, encode geometric information.</p>
